t you put into it i  think it's 20 bucks on steam i'm hoping  it comes to consoles i think this game  would actually do really well on switch  playstation and xbox i think this is  definitely a successor of final fantasy  tactics and you know ogres i think if  you love those games even a little bit  like even a little bit this is your game  for you and it's 20 bucks go out here  and support these devs they made a  fantastic game all you have to do is go  look at the steam reviews man it's  overwhelmingly positive you don't see a  game like that you know you go through  there you look at the reviews the  majority of them are positive and i'll  tell you guys right now as being a fan  of those type of ogre tactics and final  fantasy tactics this game is so good it  might be one of the best games i've  played in 2022 i definitely think it's  worth 20 bucks i got about 30 hours in  it so i think that right there just 30  hours for 20 bucks is insane now i did  get a review code so keep that in mind  but i would easily pay 20 bucks for this  game but that's the review of cynthia  the war like i said fantastic story we  were you know could have used a little  bit more visual department that has  decent artwork style but i do feel like  the animations everything could have  been  completely reworked you know obviously  that comes with budget voice acting  could have been there obviously budget  as well story was amazing gameplay was  amazing pretty much this game is an  amazing game and i think you guys should  go out there and get it if you guys  enjoyed this review you can always hit  that like button we make pretty much  reviews every month we actually have  podcasts we have a podcast every sunday  at 1 p.m the iron lures podcast and then  we have the attic show which i host  myself every wednesday at 5 00 p.m i  hope all of you guys had a good day and  until the next review this is lord  addict i'm outta here peace
 

